graph TD
    VT[Virtual thread] -->|mounted| C[Carrier / platform thread]
    C --> OS[OS thread]
    VT -.->|supported blocking operation: unmount| WAIT[Waiting virtual thread]
    WAIT -.->|resume: carrier may differ| C
```
